  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 17a73f76e324318e5907c19d3b066f8c, type: 3}
  m_Name: RepairTower
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TowerDefence.Battlefield::TowerDefence.Battlefield.TutorialDefinition
  Id: RepairTower
  Title: How to repair a tower
  Pages:
  - Select a damaged tower or foundation and choose Repair. The displayed repair
    cost is paid only when a repair succeeds.
  - Repairs restore health up to maximum health. Healthy or destroyed structures
    cannot be repaired, and invalid repairs spend no Money.
